  "description": "Wonder What's Next is the second studio album by the American rock band Chevelle, released on October 8, 2002, by Epic Records. Spawning the singles \"The Red\", \"Send the Pain Below\", and \"Closure\", it proved to be Chevelle's breakthrough album, landing them high-profile tour slots including the main stage of Ozzfest 2003. Having been certified double platinum in the US, Wonder What's Next remains the band's most successful album.",
